      "message": "We know that client devices gets registered via enumeration process/DAA on the bus. Here clients have mixed of devices under i2c and i3c busses. \n\nHere the client does bus_find_device(\u0026i3c_bus_type, ...) and finds the slave device on this bus. I2C already does it and exports i2c_bus_type(), same way i3c can export this. Clients have further usage of found devices and maintain it internally in a list.",
